- Unknowns: The real lead braking, why detection took 1.71 s, and the impact speed.
- Red flags: synthetic. Lead decel far over the mu limit. Log gap covering the incident. No police report. Crash time versus kinematics on the stated decel. No legal block. Thin evidence.
