- D: Synthetic UK generator. Lead braking, dry, daylight. Ego 8.41 m/s (about 19 mph), gap 18.0 m (headway about 2.1 s), lead at 8.41 m/s decelerating at 4.6 m/s², mu 0.7. Hazard onset 997.0, detected **999.43** (2.43 s after onset). One system brake input: 0.9 at **999.0**, which is 0.43 s before the detection. Crash at 1000.0, Slight injury. Occupant "none", automated, in ODD, software "synthetic-1.0" approved and verified.
