- Unknowns: Why detection took 2.43 s, and what contact actually occurred. The impact speed.
- Red flags: synthetic. Brake input precedes detection by 0.43 s. Collision contradicts the kinematics. No CCTV. No legal block. Thin evidence. Don't treat as a clean recovery candidate until the logs are reconciled.
